<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Note that &lt;c&gt;module_notional_filename&lt;/c&gt; from [mod://Module::Runtime], when given a module name like &lt;c&gt;"Foo::Bar"&lt;/c&gt;, will tell you what the &lt;c&gt;%INC&lt;/c&gt; key should be (&lt;c&gt;"Foo/Bar.pm"&lt;/c&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I also like [LanX]'s [id://1228232|idea] of an [doc://@INC] hook, that's a bit more powerful.&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
